  "text": "## Template 3: Rate Change Notification  \n**Subject:** Your Interest Rate Has Changed  \n```\nDear [Customer Name],\n\nThe Bank of England has changed its base rate, and your FirstUK\nBank interest rate has been updated.\n\nWhat Changed:\n- Previous Rate: [old rate]%\n- New Rate: [new rate]%\n- Effective Date: [date]\n\nWhy Did It Change?\nYour SmartSaver rate is variable, which means it moves with the\nBank of England base rate. We maintain a fixed 2.5% margin above\nBoE, so you're always competitive.\n\nWhat This Means:\nYour monthly interest will change starting next month. If rates\nincreased, you'll earn more. If they decreased, you'll earn less.\n\nExample Calculation:\n- Balance: £10,000\n- Old Interest: ~£37.50/month\n- New Interest: ~[new amount]/month\n\nNot Happy With the Change?\nIf you'd prefer a fixed rate, we recommend our Fixed Rate Bonds\n(coming 2026). Sign up for notifications at www.firstuk.bank/bonds\n\nQuestions?\n- Phone: 0800-555-2265\n- Email: support@firstuk.bank\n- View your account: www.firstuk.bank/login\n\nThank you for being a FirstUK Bank customer.\n\nFirstUK Bank Team\n```  \n---",
  "name": "Chunk 5/15",
  "domain": "banking_communications",
